 "text": "# Grupo de botões\n\nType: Bootstrap drop-in. Write standard Bootstrap 5.3.8 markup. The kit only changes the look; no new classes are needed.\nSection: Componentes\nHuman version (rendered examples): componentes/grupo-de-botoes.html\nProse language: Brazilian Portuguese. Code, class names and identifier tables are language-neutral.\n\nAgrupe botões em uma linha ou coluna.\n\n```\n<div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Grupo básico\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Esquerda</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Meio</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Direita</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Tamanhos e vertical\n\n```\n<div class=\"btn-group btn-group-sm\" role=\"group\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">1</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">2</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group btn-group-lg\" role=\"group\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">1</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">2</button>\n</div>\n<div class=\"btn-group-vertical\" role=\"group\">\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Cima</button>\n  <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">Baixo</button>\n</div>\n```\n\n## Barra de ferramentas e radio\n\n```\n<div class=\"btn-toolbar gap-2\" role=\"toolbar\">\n  <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">1</button>\n    <button class=\"btn btn-secondary\">2</button>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"btn-group\" role=\"group\">\n    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"tbr\" id=\"tbr1\" checked>\n    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary\" for=\"tbr1\">A</label>\n    <input type=\"radio\" class=\"btn-check\" name=\"tbr\" id=\"tbr2\">\n    <label class=\"btn btn-outline-primary\" for=\"tbr2\">B</label>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n« Botões · Card »\n",
